  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文獻研討",
    "sub_ename": "LITERATURE DISCUSSION",
    "describe_ch": "文獻研討訓練學生閱讀報告科技文獻，並完成碩士論文提案。本課程預期修習之研究生需學 習組織研究動機、管理論文提案之範圍、架構研究計畫、論文格式和完成文獻報告寫作。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to help students get through the thesis research process by focusing on a key step: designing a research proposal. Thesis proposal will be evaluated. The course is intended to help students organize ideas, manage the scope of proposal, plan for the research structure and format of a thesis. It gives students a chance to collaborate group persons others in the research field.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
